{"seq":1,"slug":"metaphysics","title":"Metaphysics","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/ideas-and-methods/metaphysics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"substance-and-form","title":"实体与形式","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/ideas-and-methods/metaphysics/substance-and-form","wordCount":1588,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-four-causes","title":"四因说","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/ideas-and-methods/metaphysics/the-four-causes","wordCount":1391,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现亚里士多德的形而上学。通过对\"实体\"的探究，他回答了\"什么是真正的存在\"这一根本问题；他以\"形式与质料\"的学说，将事物的本质（形式）内在化于具体事物之中，从而超越了柏拉图的理念论。而著名的\"四因说\"——质料因、形式因、动力因、目的因——则提供了一个全面解释事物\"为何如此\"的框架。本章揭示亚里士多德形而上学的深邃。\n"}